      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">order</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">1) A direction or command of a court. In this sense it is often used synonymously with judgment. 
2) The document bearing the seal of the court recording its judgment in a case.</skos:scopeNote>
