      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">granulometry</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">1) The determination of the different grain size in a granular material.
2) The proportion by weight of particles of different sizes in granular material.</skos:scopeNote>
