      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">land tax</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Property tax. A tax laid upon the legal or beneficial owner of real property, and apportioned upon the assessed value of his land.</skos:scopeNote>
