      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">biological cycle</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A series of transformations or biological events which follow one after the other one, reaching at the end of the cycle the initial conditions, as in the life cycle of many animal and plant organisms.</skos:scopeNote>
