      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">documentary system</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A coordinated assemblage of people, devices or other resources providing written, printed or digitized items that furnish or substantiate information or evidence.</skos:scopeNote>
