      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">criminal law</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">That body of the law that deals with conduct considered so harmful to society as a whole that it is prohibited by statute, prosecuted and punished by the government.</skos:scopeNote>
