      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">1) Removal of groundwater or surface water, or of water from structures, by gravity or pumping.
2) The discharge of water from a soil by percolation (the process by which surface water moves downwards through cracks, joints and pores in soil and rocks).</skos:scopeNote>
