      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">effluent</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The waste liquid from domestic sewage, industrial sites or from agricultural processes. Effluents are harmful when they enter the environment, especially in freshwater, because of their polluting chemical composition.</skos:scopeNote>
