   <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/2578">
      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">EIA directive</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Council Directive of 27 June 1985 on the assessment of the effects of certain public and private projects on the environment (85/337/EEC). The Directive applies to projects which are likely to have significant effects on the environment by virtue of their nature, size or location.</skos:scopeNote>
