      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">energy source</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Potential supplies of energy including fossil and nuclear fuels as well as solar, water, wind, tidal and geothermal power.</skos:scopeNote>
