      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">food colourant</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Any digestible substance, usually a synthetic dye, which manufacturers add to food to give it color and enhance its appearance.</skos:scopeNote>
