      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">housing legislation</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A binding rule or body of rules prescribed by a government to regulate the buying, selling, leasing, construction or maintenance of dwelling places.</skos:scopeNote>
