      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">long-term trend</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The prevailing tendency or general direction expected for some observed value over a lengthy and extended period of time, often determined by studying and analyzing statistical data.</skos:scopeNote>
