      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">testing of materials</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The complex of tests performed in order to ascertain the characteristics and behaviour of materials; they are classified in physical and chemical tests, mechanical tests and technological tests.</skos:scopeNote>
