      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">moral persuasion</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Appealing to the ethical principles or beliefs of an adversary or the public to convince the adversary to change behavior or attitudes.</skos:scopeNote>
