      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">artificial satellite</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Any man-made object placed in a near-periodic orbit in which it moves mainly under the gravitational influence of one celestial body, such as the earth, sun, another planet, or a planet's moon.</skos:scopeNote>
