      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">pulp</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The cellulosic material produced by reducing wood mechanically or chemically and used in making paper and cellulose products. Also known as wood pulp.</skos:scopeNote>
