   <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/6861">
      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">quality of life</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Quality of life is largely a matter of individual preference and perception and overlaps the concept of social well-being. Generally the emphasis is on the amount and distribution of jointly consumed public goods, such as health care and welfare services, protection against crime, regulation of pollution, preservation of fine landscapes and historic townscapes.</skos:scopeNote>
