      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">poriferan</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The sponges, a phylum of the animal kingdom characterized by the presence of canal systems and chambers through which water is drawn in and released; tissues and organs are absent.</skos:scopeNote>
