   <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/8381">
      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">termite</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A soft-bodied insect of the order Isoptera; individuals feed on cellulose and live in colonies with a caste system comprising three types of functional individuals: sterile workers and soldiers, and the reproductives. Also known as white ant.</skos:scopeNote>
