      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">terrestrial ecosystem</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Any terrestrial environment, from small to large, in which plants and animals interact with the chemical and physical features of the environment.</skos:scopeNote>
