      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">tourism</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The temporary movement of people to destinations outside their normal places or work and residence, the activities undertaken during their stay in those destinations and the facilities created to cater for their needs.</skos:scopeNote>
