      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">boundary layer</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">The layer of fluid adjacent to a physical boundary in which the fluid motion is significantly affected by the boundary and has a mean velocity less than the free stream value.</skos:scopeNote>
